  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health support to Palestine through the deployment of emergency medical teams, and rehabilitation of medical facilities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deployment of emergency medical teams and the rehabilitation of medical facilities will strengthen the delivery of essential health services, including medical consultations, life-saving surgeries, emergency care, management of non-communicable diseases, and comprehensive ante- and post-natal care. These efforts will also support safe deliveries and ensure the provision of high-quality primary health care services to affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
